{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51985","headline":"思归 · 晁衡","name":"思归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慕义名空在，轮忠孝不全。\n报恩无有日，归国定何年？\n（《古今和歌集》（《光明日报》一九七八年八月二十日王仁波文引）（〖1〗《古今和歌集》无此诗。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》据《阿倍仲麻吕研究》一五七页引《国史》录此诗，「报恩」作「报国」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"晁衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}